{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0e4251a539d939fbb92dc47c02dc4634ab606aba944ff261b394f5dd12078a26","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6bc19cd03dee61027a4acbfce29b980a66503bbff7539d11cccfdfcecc9944b9","slc_9ab302d6b7df31474bff3bcee6fc1ab2c456e77b0811808511fdfbab92056c58","slc_cad14178566049e1a38ccc3d2e0d569d1e821451a0fba49ae0e4b5cb3e8bc73c","slc_e4426c99aea8a7e377a6723790250d13bac090845d5abb49341456d766d1d22f"],"source_ids":["src_d86caacffeb959b98224e809250edad0","src_e361bf4545be5159945eb84b83b5c0a7","src_f0da4b17648057c28619e11006e8f9cf"],"text":"Trajectories persist in a Turso (SQLite) store defaulting to ~/.sondera/trajectories/trajectories.db, overridable via --db; the console reads agents and trajectories from the same store.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_151be13f17087c676c76c50fa013810f91a0db8e8fd85e1e01d7c53462f871c4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_00d9c4015efb7ec36c0988c14ef5e976e20663cf2677b0a792ca8f9713a9e408"],"source_ids":["src_e361bf4545be5159945eb84b83b5c0a7"],"text":"Repository development practice: integration tests needing a reachable model provider are #[ignore]d by default and run explicitly with `cargo test -- --ignored` once the configured provider is up.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_27d771a4615fbcfb0f831dc6ebc3d807780d2876177289fb5125954e43a0c26f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_08f561e14580057506e2db528670a1418742f5442e09d3ea983caf0e68cfeee4","slc_2153e75d5431eb2c7b72273c16520e29214ad872ea159636d838d6cb05c46cfd","slc_68b65de9c888a9f593446b3d6cd9ea8858e767b9fbd76b1b67e84b4b33ad3732","slc_833a03e6f463c7b3802948e8accd387a5e407e7183e80877a9591356b7f2e1a1","slc_9b821f3423c5495595bd4aa215db7e1b2f724b2e51364ba320d220c51066d341"],"source_ids":["src_e361bf4545be5159945eb84b83b5c0a7"],"text":"Repository development practice: CI runs cargo fmt --check, clippy with -D warnings, cargo doc, cargo test --locked --workspace, cargo deny check, and buf lint/format from crates/schema/proto; working conventions live in AGENTS.md.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_282c65fb898dbc36c04ca741468f17d4fe306b35cfe25c16f96733339b435d11","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6f90ba8e936e8004b99efd0ba64fa15bf21154a009a9062ebb25f0b94ae85089","slc_714e9b65a8b0f70c1d03e0af8987985293e13b773b778ff301b7b6c00a13fa26"],"source_ids":["src_d86caacffeb959b98224e809250edad0","src_fa7cb92e480157b48a7e8c3e9b4754f4"],"text":"Enabling the LLM classifiers adds latency to every decision they touch, and with guardrails enabled event content is sent to the configured provider.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2e75df0423716b7eb4c091eb3655c1c73464b5c8c6790a97c2d6d57a61e9f4d5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7abe19841616eefc11fce37991a2a560ee3b0e5db2170b503898bbb33a460fdf"],"source_ids":["src_01675cc58c7b54a0b51e577833b380da"],"text":"The harness coordinates three guardrail subsystems: a YARA-X signature engine (always on and the only deterministic one), an optional LLM secure-code policy classifier, and optional LLM information-flow sensitivity labeling.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3a741e09d77fec14ba60d2e5a9ae0b274fa33b27303aa30df5d27b2d97db7b71","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_714e9b65a8b0f70c1d03e0af8987985293e13b773b778ff301b7b6c00a13fa26","slc_c68ea742b60e51971e9282d50d0fc526bad5d72ad892008024d466b786ed1758"],"source_ids":["src_01675cc58c7b54a0b51e577833b380da","src_d86caacffeb959b98224e809250edad0"],"text":"The optional LLM classifiers fail open when disabled, erroring, or slower than the adjudication budget — to compliant with no violations and to Public — so Cedar and the deterministic policies still decide.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_58dec173115ed2b423be7154e433283dda251967e8fda2d4f71ff19d60f81761","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_31501711aea9e86891b3798e904f846d97ddd605441a211d3630a207d9d0a365"],"source_ids":["src_e361bf4545be5159945eb84b83b5c0a7"],"text":"Every hook adapter depends on the harness crate as sondera-harness-client with default-features off and only the client feature, linking the gRPC client but not the policy engine.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_62c117de4ded26410eb724f0fcc8271166c43e9219430589de5e69647fb51b55","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_05e764465a6debf344987093cb93e7fdcbbce7943f9bfcef795b908c1f2c469b","slc_0e20956f94e35609bd1a7af13d59a0c385a0f2517ed81b48de5da2cfd143e86b","slc_eb8114627d01cc648297adc2bb3de4babbdab80a46b33f978299506a7f28a2c6","slc_f70d009accdd8fd2bfa4f47a006556b674d2b095c4589bc3b03e19243e56f072"],"source_ids":["src_37fbb8c2c9bb5d9790b97afd84976bce","src_d86caacffeb959b98224e809250edad0"],"text":"The signature engine and Cedar policies run with no external dependencies or API keys; the optional LLM classifiers support Ollama (the default when enabled), OpenAI-compatible servers, Anthropic, Gemini, and Vertex AI via Application Default Credentials.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7783327bc069eb34f4f2ce168fe6716dc241982bfa659502336eedb6607d1c86","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_84e99033045641945bae7085a94b18fa4661edc824e3c52f040958a99acf5318","slc_e658a44b257aaa904ed20d72efcdaa05e24daa93e5cc9404ddddc5d503ed315b"],"source_ids":["src_01675cc58c7b54a0b51e577833b380da"],"text":"Agent execution is modeled as a trajectory of typed events in four categories: Action (pre-execution), Observation (post-execution), Control (lifecycle), and State (environment snapshots).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7a57cadd1c414fb6b86affaf23659e238323b1f38ce4fc1872cd33a8db67904e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a8862a031c11043a608027425499965728d88a5c6b0eea62e7f60a0d9f9f5d77","slc_bf1c8ce2da66daae85354fd595cc333f34ee516dfe097981ef1bd1e30aae13c8"],"source_ids":["src_37fbb8c2c9bb5d9790b97afd84976bce","src_fa7cb92e480157b48a7e8c3e9b4754f4"],"text":"Enforcement hooks fail closed: a hook that cannot reach the harness denies preventive events and never proceeds unadjudicated, so losing the server blocks the agent rather than ungoverning it.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7f7b6605c571d369fa524101d1df8ae9f1b2a6d10f929c62895d4780b44a69ef","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e4426c99aea8a7e377a6723790250d13bac090845d5abb49341456d766d1d22f","slc_eb8a6303824bf31a60ec6e87dbe328a9abe978d3a6b43b46d3ce00c604c5dde0"],"source_ids":["src_f0da4b17648057c28619e11006e8f9cf"],"text":"`sondera serve` runs two gRPC surfaces on one address: `sondera.harness.v1` for Cedar-backed adjudication and `sondera.console.v1` for agent and trajectory reads over the same store.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8767f500c0ffa2ddd79be00717321c6c9125448995e9b94ae40097ee222889ef","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_242364530e388e978870fb0a770207f906a0651cd08fa23a67784981c5ad850a"],"source_ids":["src_01675cc58c7b54a0b51e577833b380da"],"text":"The Cedar policy engine combines guardrail signals with entity state from a Turso (SQLite) local store and returns Allow, Deny, or Escalate adjudications back through the hook adapter.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_88ed8a71d007983c82e9c01c87da37e888b9248facff52d23c5abc89708dd93d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fe93b7044cc9006bdd9fa003afef7c7dd5c6ecab2fe32836c4bd96cde79b5350"],"source_ids":["src_01675cc58c7b54a0b51e577833b380da"],"text":"Agent-specific tool names normalize to shared event types (Claude's Bash, Cursor's shell hook, Copilot's and Gemini's bash all become ShellCommand), so one Cedar rule set governs every supported agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9199d2916301eb69ee465747887bbc77c211d10431e79444f9d89588f0caa566","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8f9a10fc877f48dac696c2336679800520f2dbfc0538781ff4984636767edb34","slc_962799c7e8cc1831a0b7a15eeed0fbb86e300474681edc41272b98abbd4457dc"],"source_ids":["src_37fbb8c2c9bb5d9790b97afd84976bce"],"text":"The project targets AI coding agents — Claude Code, Cursor, GitHub Copilot, and Gemini CLI, plus adapters for Antigravity, Codex, Hermes, OpenCode, OpenHands, and VS Code — intercepting shell commands, file operations, and web requests.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b681d68111c5abe390647f360132cd7da05640b2c7eb469edf57a106aa232433","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_157c49739e990af278c506a155448fb896ec28eb89fdc9983af931e254317b15","slc_17e0c75c9697617b711a7622fdd22055abc0ba5589b71ee79406cee5f1a5ac00"],"source_ids":["src_fa7cb92e480157b48a7e8c3e9b4754f4"],"text":"Neither gRPC surface authenticates its caller: adjudication is plain HTTP/2 gRPC and the console returns the whole local store and exposes agent deletion, so the bind address should stay on loopback or behind an authenticating proxy.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_bf8497c681173ea7473cce5d7575717ec448844610374f088825240865108883","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a46e8694975fcfe5bf1e049910bc2f8f2fac870caed0489d1044b588c6ea3b38"],"source_ids":["src_01675cc58c7b54a0b51e577833b380da"],"text":"Hook adapters speak stdin/stdout JSON with each agent, normalize the payload, and forward it over gRPC to `sondera serve` on loopback TCP, 127.0.0.1:50051 by default.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f550331e2cdc019645cd24aa3e4dbd228fbc6d345391de39c7ca3e2ae8054b5e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"sondera-ai/sondera-coding-agent-hooks@9efefedd249e snapshot 5bba1d792787685d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_98bf5b2b633fecbba5a5f33737b03cd340fd3ccaf87e77888956a3f4602c551c","slc_c76229190f66aa37166c035d2a704b1e5c66a73ca7178bca9166cb7c88db5169"],"source_ids":["src_37fbb8c2c9bb5d9790b97afd84976bce"],"text":"Adapters can act on decisions as block (deny, fail-closed), ask (escalate to the host approval UI), steer (inject context), redact (replace tool output), terminate (stop the loop), or observe only, with capability varying per adapter and hook group.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:22:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3f0ec349a8ce4f3a950726d28a52970a"}
